  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "The Ship Enterprise is on a 5 year mission: To explore strange new worlds, to seek out new life and new civilizations, to boldly go where no man has gone before. While the Enterprise is investigating strange gravitational disturbances, it is drawn into a dimensional hole and ends up in unknown space with broken warp engines. Now, Captain Kirk and his crew must try to repair the ship and find a way home.\n\nGameplay is divided into two parts, taking place on the ship's bridge and away missions. On the bridge, you can communicate with other ships, call up a map to navigate the ship (once the warp engines are fixed), enter battle mode to fight other ships (which does not happen very often), save the game or beam down to a planet's surface.\nThese away missions make up the major part of the game and play very much like other action adventures. You can talk to aliens find and use objects, solve puzzles and fight against hostile lifeforms.  Battles with other ships or on away missions are handled in simple Shoot'em Up-fashion.\r"
    },
    {
      "langue": "fr",
      "text": "Le vaisseau Enterprise est sur une mission de 5 ans: explorer de nouveaux mondes étranges, rechercher une nouvelle vie et de nouvelles civilisations, aller audacieusement là où aucun homme n'est allé auparavant. Alors que l'Enterprise étudie d'étranges perturbations gravitationnelles, il est entraîné dans un trou dimensionnel et se retrouve dans un espace inconnu avec des moteurs de distorsion brisés. Maintenant, le capitaine Kirk et son équipe doivent essayer de réparer le navire et trouver un moyen de rentrer chez eux."
    },
    {
      "langue": "de",
      "text": "Dies sind die Abenteuer des Raumschiffs Enterprise, das mit seiner 400 Mann starken Besatzung 5 Jahre lang unterwegs ist, um neue Welten zu erforschen, neues Leben und neue Zivilisationen. Viele Lichtjahre von der Erde entfernt, dringt die Enterprise in Galaxien vor, die nie ein Mensch zuvor gesehen hat. Während die Enterprise seltsame Gravitationsstörungen untersucht, wird sie in ein Dimensionsloch gezogen und landet mit defektem Warpantrieb im unbekannten Raum. Nun müssen Captain Kirk und seine Crew versuchen, das Schiff zu reparieren und einen Weg nach Hause zu finden."
    },
    {
      "langue": "es",
      "text": "La nave Enterprise tiene una misión de 5 años: explorar nuevos mundos extraños, buscar nuevas vidas y nuevas civilizaciones, ir audazmente a donde ningún hombre ha ido antes. Mientras la Enterprise investiga extrañas perturbaciones gravitacionales, se introduce en un agujero dimensional y termina en un espacio desconocido con los motores warp rotos. Ahora, el capitán Kirk y su tripulación deben tratar de reparar la nave y encontrar el camino a casa."
    },
    {
      "langue": "it",
      "text": "La nave Enterprise ha una missione di 5 anni: esplorare strani nuovi mondi, cercare nuova vita e nuove civiltà, andare coraggiosamente dove nessun uomo è mai giunto prima. Mentre l'Enterprise sta indagando su strani disturbi gravitazionali, viene trascinata in un buco dimensionale e finisce in uno spazio sconosciuto con motori a curvatura rotti. Ora, il Capitano Kirk e il suo equipaggio devono cercare di riparare la nave e trovare una via di casa."
    },
    {
      "langue": "pt",
      "text": "A empresa naval está em uma missão de 5 anos: explorar novos mundos estranhos, procurar novas vidas e novas civilizações, ousadamente ir aonde nenhum homem foi antes. Enquanto a Enterprise está investigando estranhos distúrbios gravitacionais, ela é arrastada para um buraco dimensional e acaba em um espaço desconhecido com motores de dobra quebrados. Agora, o capitão Kirk e sua tripulação devem tentar consertar o navio e encontrar um caminho de casa."
    }
  ],
